  "body": "The post-merge run 44939973278 on `ad0307b7a` failed two `camcraft-ui` lib tests. This PR changes only these two test files. It changes no shipped file.\n\n## What changed\n\n1. `guide_projects::indexed_guide_preserves_legacy_basis_and_path` failed with \"documented warning lost: FirstTraverseLow { height_mm: 10.0, top_mm: 11.114, fixture: false, tilted: false }\".\n   - Cause: #3080 (#2991) now gives the 3+2 `FirstTraverseLow` warning in the user's frame with `tilted: true`. The change is on purpose. The cache saved in `examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj` keeps the old local-frame form. `site/content/guide/multi-axis/indexed.md` (#3080) documents the two forms: 10 / 11.114 mm along the tool axis, and 30 / 31.114 mm after a regenerate, with a raise of 1.114 mm.\n   - Fix: the new helper `same_warning` reads a saved `tilted: false` `FirstTraverseLow` as the same warning in the new form. It must have the same move (`at`), the same `fixture`, `tilted: true` and the same raise (`top_mm - height_mm`, to 1e-6).\n   - Why the absolute heights are not compared: #3080 moved them to the user's frame on purpose. The raise is the same in each frame, so the test compares the raise.\n   - Every other warning, and an upright `FirstTraverseLow`, must still match exactly. The path asserts do not change.\n   - New negative pin `a_legacy_first_traverse_warning_matches_only_the_same_raise`. A different raise, a fixture top, an upright warning or another move does not match.\n2. `machines_pane::the_sheet_states_rigid_tapping_in_words` failed because no node had the label \"Rigid tapping\". The sheet stayed at \"Select a machine to see its properties.\"\n   - Cause: #3204 put \"Fehlmann Picomax 55 (iTNC 530)\" in as row 2 of `MACHINES`. The 770M row moved past the clip edge of the list, so the click selected nothing.\n   - Fix: the test asserts that the row exists, calls `scroll_to_me()` on it, and then clicks. `break_through.rs` uses the same pattern.\n\n## Tests\n\n- In `.claude/worktrees/issue-3233`, `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- egui_app::tests::guide_projects egui_app::tests::machines_pane`: 13 passed.\n- Whole `camcraft-ui` lib: 1387 passed, 0 failed, 7 ignored.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- 0 CR in the changed files.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No heavy lane. The diff is tests only, in `crates/ui`.\n- The example cache is not regenerated. Follow-up: #3234 (P7).\n- PR #3147 is not related. It changes only `crates/app/tests/ai_guide.rs`.\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: high (the issue is labelled effort:low; no escalation)\n\nFixes #3233\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
